            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Described herein are methods and systems for evaluating cell samples, including tissue samples such as cancer tissue. In some cases, evaluating cell samples comprises longitudinal evaluation of one or more candidate molecules. Methods and systems for assessing cellular viability are provided.</p>
